<title>USA: Mutual Risk Management Ltd Q4 net, shr rise.</title>
<headline>Mutual Risk Management Ltd Q4 net, shr rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.49		    $0.39</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.49		     0.40</p>
<p> Net		 9,509		    7,451</p>
<p> Revs		47,621		   28,276</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  19,289		   18,786</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.93		    $1.62</p>
<p> Shr diluted     1.91		     1.63</p>
<p> Net		 37,198		   30,354</p>
<p> Revs		157,702		  127,493</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  19,150		   18,574</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 and 1995 Q4 include $0.03 per share charge for realized capital losses, net of tax. 1996 full-year includes $0.08 per share charge for realized capital losses, net of tax, and 1995 full-year includes $0.04 per share charge for realized capital losses net of tax.</p>
<p>All per share amounts adjusted to reflect four-for-three stock split effected May 31, 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
